stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> none
  none --> pending: Current deal read finds proposal
  pending --> comparing: Compare
  comparing --> choosing: Use theirs, Keep mine or property choice
  choosing --> choosing: Revise local choices
  choosing --> accepting: Accept
  accepting --> accepted: Receipt and shortlist readback confirmed
  accepting --> stale: Shortlist version refused
  accepting --> refused: Refused or outcome unconfirmed
  stale --> choosing: Refresh comparison, preserve choices
  refused --> accepting: Replay same request
  accepted --> pending: Next pending proposal
  pending --> none: Session ends or no pending proposals
